    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project DAR is an intellectual puzzle game with psychological thriller elements, where you alone face off against an AI, trying to convince it of humanity's worth. You're an &quot;average&quot; person\u2014chosen by the AI itself. Every decision brings you closer to victory or ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex puzzles ranging from math riddles to philosophical dilemmas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist style focused on atmosphere and tension, with no unnecessary elements.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project DAR is an intellectual puzzle game with psychological thriller elements, where you alone face off against an AI, trying to convince it of humanity's worth. You're an &quot;average&quot; person\u2014chosen by the AI itself. Every decision brings you closer to victory or ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex puzzles ranging from math riddles to philosophical dilemmas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist style focused on atmosphere and tension, with no unnecessary elements.</p></li></ul>",
